  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to 200 Orphans children in Bangladesh</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will target to 200 orphans around the Sub-District of District Kurigram in Bangladesh. The children aged between 0-15 years those are living below the poverty line. We empower the orphans by working closely with various institutes. We will support orphans by providing them with good food, quality education, psycho-social support,  health services ,cultural program and extra-curricular interventions  for orphans. We reach out to children through a family-centered approach .</narrative>
  </description>
